{"Author":"ash","Name":"Show Gear","Punchline":"Shows your gear in the Fitting Room by default.","Description":"Normally the Fitting Room defaults to showing you just the piece of gear you’re trying on. This plugin inverts that behaviour: when you launch the game, the Fitting Room (plus Item Dyeing and Glamour Plate Selection) will show all your gear by default.

